{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10124150","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10124150","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1012415001:1":{"text":"快快快！把这些东西搬到圣丘去——嗯？不对……你们是谁？","source_cn":"快快快！把这些东西搬到圣丘去——嗯？不对……你们是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DD77440B6A3A67F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012415002:1":{"text":"你好先生，我们从薄暮丛林来。","source_cn":"你好先生，我们从薄暮丛林来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x110E6E46740121EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012415003:1":{"text":"真稀奇，你们是怎么进入月影乡的？我们这里很久很久都没出现过外人了。","source_cn":"真稀奇，你们是怎么进入月影乡的？我们这里很久很久都没出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EBFD72B068BB993","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012415004:1":{"text":"怎么向你解释呢……应该说，有一群<style=\"highlight\">黑色蝴蝶</style>指引了我们。","source_cn":"怎么向你解释呢……应该说，有一群<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F971865DF109B8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012415005:2":{"text":"黑、黑蝴蝶？！你们确定吗？这话可千万不能乱说啊！","source_cn":"黑、黑蝴蝶？！你们确定吗？这话可千万不能乱说啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5BFEC622545BB00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_ti